System Version: 2.0 (Production-Ready Architecture)
Target Portal : Pacino's Restaurant & Admin HQ (admin.pacinos.uk)
Tech Stack    : Laravel 11.x REST API, MySQL, Atomic Transactions, Idempotent Logic
